        "subtitle": "Sessions and hot reads",
        "eyebrow": "CACHE",
        "chip": "HIT 85%",
        "zoneLabel": "Data Tier",
        "summary": "Answers most reads in under a millisecond. On a miss it reads through to the replica and keeps the answer for its TTL.",
        "metrics": [
